:: Fishing Beach Trash Catch
<<effects>>
<<if $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase is "fishing">>
	<<fishingBeachCatchTrashFisher>>
<<else>>
	<<fishingBeachCatchTrash>>
<</if>>

:: Widgets Fishing Beach Trash Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingBeachCatchTrashFisher">>
	<<fishingTrashCatchText $fishingTrash>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.trashCaught to ($daily.fishing.trashCaught ?? 0) + 1>>
	<br><br>

	<<if setup.fishing.lootTables.fishingTrash[$fishingTrash].isLitter and $rng lt 50>>
		<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
		<<switch random(1, 2)>>
			<<case 1>>
				"어떤 날엔 고기보다 쓰레기가 더 많다니까," <<personsimple>>【이가】 당신이 낚은 것을 힐끗 보며 말한다.
			<<case 2>>
				<<personsimple>>【은는】 고개를 내젓는다. "사람들은 쓰레기를 아무 데나 버린단 말이야. 장소에 대한 예의가 없어."
		<</switch>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<unset $fishingTrash>>

	<<link [[다음|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</widget>>


<<widget "fishingBeachCatchTrash">>
	<<fishingTrashCatchText $fishingTrash>>
	<<unset $fishingTrash>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.trashCaught to ($daily.fishing.trashCaught ?? 0) + 1>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>
